---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: GMOOCA, Inc. builds SAS and G2S slot machine management software and hardware for owners, operators, collectors and small casinos, plus plain-language guides. Follow Gaming Manager 2 and 3 and the SAS Gateway.
reels:
  - word: Owners
    strip: ["7", "BAR", "◆", "7", "BAR", "★", "7", "◆", "BAR"]
    text: Bought a machine for the game room? Learn what's inside it, how it talks to other equipment, and how to keep it running.
  - word: Operators
    strip: ["BAR", "★", "7", "◆", "BAR", "7", "★", "BAR", "7"]
    text: Running a parlor, a route or a small casino? Our software tracks meters, events and tickets at a price that fits, with enterprise and regulatory features on the way.
  - word: Collectors
    strip: ["◆", "7", "BAR", "★", "◆", "BAR", "7", "★", "◆"]
    text: Keeping older cabinets alive? Trade parts sources, history and restoration notes with people who care about the same machines.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="hero-title">A home base for the people who own, run and keep gaming machines.</h1>
    <p class="hero-lede">{{ site.legalName }} builds software and hardware that let slot machine owners, operators and collectors run their machines the way casinos do, and writes plain-language guides to go with them. We've been at it since {{ site.founded }}.</p>
    <p class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#notify">Get forum launch updates</a>
      <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="#projects">See what we're building</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cabinet" aria-hidden="true">
      {% for reel in reels %}
      <div class="reel-window">
        <div class="reel-strip" style="--stop: {{ reel.strip | length }}; --i: {{ loop.index0 }}">
          {% for s in reel.strip %}<span class="sym">{{ s }}</span>{% endfor %}
          <span class="sym sym-win">{{ reel.word }}</span>
          <span class="sym">{{ reel.strip[0] }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <ul class="audiences" aria-label="Who GMOOCA is for">
      {% for reel in reels %}
      <li>
        <h2>{{ reel.word }}</h2>
        <p>{{ reel.text }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" aria-labelledby="why-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="why-h">How GMOOCA works</h2>
    <ul class="principles">
      <li>
        <h3>No gatekeeping</h3>
        <p>In this industry, systems, parts and know-how are usually reserved for licensed casinos. GMOOCA's software, hardware and guides are open to anyone who owns a machine, from a single cabinet in a game room to a small casino floor.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Built on the real standards</h3>
        <p>Gaming Manager speaks SAS and G2S, the same protocols casino systems use, and features are proven on real machines on our own bench before release.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Reinvested in the work</h3>
        <p>Most of what GMOOCA earns goes back into research and development: test machines, prototype hardware, and industry association memberships so we work from the latest GSA standards and tools.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="principles-note">We're not here to replace the communities and projects owners already rely on, like <a href="https://newlifegames.com/">New Life Games</a> and <a href="https://github.com/ajs1616/CabiNet">CabiNet</a>. We want to build on what they've started. <a href="/about/#where-gmooca-fits">Where GMOOCA fits</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head">
      <h2 id="projects-h">What we're building</h2>
      <p class="band-meta">Last updated <time datetime="{{ projects | latestUpdate }}">{{ projects | latestUpdate | readableDate }}</time></p>
    </div>

    <ol class="projects">
      {% for p in projects %}{% if p.home !== false %}
      {% set current = p | phaseIndex %}
      <li class="project">
        <div class="project-main">
          <p class="project-kind">{{ p.kind }}</p>
          <h3>{{ p.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ p.summary }}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="project-status">
          <ol class="phases" aria-label="{{ p.name }} progress: {{ p.phase }} phase">
            {% for ph in p.phases %}
            <li class="{% if loop.index0 < current %}done{% elif loop.index0 == current %}now{% endif %}"{% if loop.index0 == current %} aria-current="step"{% endif %}><span>{{ ph }}</span></li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ol>
          <p class="project-note">{{ p.note }}</p>
          <p class="project-date">Updated <time datetime="{{ p.updated }}">{{ p.updated | readableDate }}</time></p>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <p><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">Full project history</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band-alt" aria-labelledby="guides-h">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <h2 id="guides-h">Guides</h2>
      <p>Most modern slot machines speak one of two languages to the outside world. Our guides explain what those languages do, why they matter to an owner, and where GMOOCA fits in, without assuming you're an engineer.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="guide-list">
      <li>
        <a href="/guides/sas/">
          <span class="guide-title">SAS, explained</span>
          <span class="guide-desc">The serial link that lets a machine report meters, events and vouchers. Found on nearly every machine built since the late 1990s.</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/guides/g2s/">
          <span class="guide-title">G2S, explained</span>
          <span class="guide-desc">The newer network-based standard, how it differs from SAS, and why most home machines will never use it.</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="notify" aria-labelledby="forums-h">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <h2 id="forums-h">The forums aren't open yet</h2>
      <p>We're setting up forums and a download library for owners, operators and collectors. Leave your email and we'll send one message when registration opens. Nothing else.</p>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/notify-form.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
